{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":198,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L05-1-16\",\"沒有空\",\"沒（有）空\",\"没（有）空\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想去朋友家玩，可是沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng qù péngyǒu jiā wán, kěshì méi yǒukòng.","english":"I would like to go to my friend’s place, but I don’t have time.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-02","sourceFront":"可是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"沒(not) + 有(have) + 空(free time) → no free time: 沒有空 means unavailable."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-15\",\"考\",\"考\",\"考\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"期中考快要到了，老師說我們可以去圖書館對面的大教室看書。","pinyin":"Qízhōngkǎo kuàiyào dào le, lǎoshī shuō wǒmen kěyǐ qù túshūguǎn duìmiàn de dà jiàoshì kànshū.","english":"The midterm exam is coming soon. The teacher said we could use the big classroom across from the library for studying.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"an 耂(old) teacher takes a 丂(kǎo) test → the final 考(test)."},{"key":"[\"B1L11-1-17\",\"決定\",\"決定\",\"决定\",\"Vp/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"友美說她想去，我還沒決定去不去。燈會好玩嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi shuō tā xiǎng qù, wǒ háiméi juédìng qù bú qù. Dēnghuì hǎowán ma?","english":"Youmei wants to see it. But I haven’t decided to go. Is the Lantern Carnival fun?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"決(decide) + 定(fixed) → to decide is to make a fixed choice."},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-34\",\"沒辦法\",\"沒辦法\",\"没办法\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個老人年紀太大，沒辦法一個人生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-29","sourceFront":"老人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小孩子的手比較沒有力，沒辦法拿很重的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-06","sourceFront":"力","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然陸先生這幾年工作機會不斷，但是因為身體不好的關係一直沒辦法去上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-13","sourceFront":"不斷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生這幾天一直發燒，腦子很不清楚，恐怕沒辦法寫劇本。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-17","sourceFront":"腦","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說經理後天就要離開公司了。 這個消息太突然了，大家一時沒辦法接受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-04","sourceFront":"突然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的水災不僅淹了整條街，好幾家工廠也因為淹水沒辦法生產，真是太糟了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-29","sourceFront":"水災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為水災的關係，許多學校沒辦法正常上課，甚至連便利商店都關了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-15","sourceFront":"甚至","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位老太太年紀大了，沒辦法照顧他的狗，所以想幫狗找個新主人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-28","sourceFront":"主人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的露營活動因為颱風辦不成了，可以說計畫永遠沒辦法趕上變化","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-09","sourceFront":"趕上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那班飛機因為天氣的關係，沒辦法準時抵達","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-01","sourceFront":"抵達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子是父母最親愛的寶貝，父母對他們的愛是沒辦法用文字來形容的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-23","sourceFront":"形容","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"博物館裡的東西非常寶貴， 它們具有民族和文化的價值， 沒辦法用錢算清楚的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為學校缺乏經費，宿舍的電腦設備暫時沒辦法改善。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-17","sourceFront":"經費","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座地下停車場因為缺乏經費，沒辦法改善又暗又溼的情形。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-23","sourceFront":"暗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到地震災區救災的軍人們，這幾天忙得連一頓飯都沒辦法好好地吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-04","sourceFront":"頓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這件事我根本不了解，所以沒辦法給你適當的建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-20","sourceFront":"根本","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-1-25\",\"推薦\",\"推薦\",\"推荐\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"朋友推薦我去參觀這裡有名的博物館。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-25","sourceFront":"推薦","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本小說很有意思，值得推薦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-27","sourceFront":"值得","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"莫以凡覺得推薦的「薦」很難寫，連他的台灣朋友也常寫錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-12","sourceFront":"連","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王教授推薦我去念那個研究所的翻譯課程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-05","sourceFront":"課程","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小簡向很多公司自我推薦，經過了幾個月，最後找到了滿意的工作","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-14","sourceFront":"經過","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳不僅服務態度好，而且食物好吃又便宜，難怪大家都推薦我來嚐嚐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-03","sourceFront":"不僅","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-09\",\"逛街\",\"逛街\",\"逛街\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我常常跟朋友一起去逛街。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-09","sourceFront":"逛街","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:何小姐只是我的鄰居，不是我的女朋友，大家都誤會了。 B:你對她很體貼，不但常送她上班，還常陪她逛街，大家對你們有誤會也是正常的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-06","sourceFront":"誤會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我逛街時經過了一排小吃攤，就買幾樣回來當作宵夜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-39","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-2-02\",\"隨時\",\"隨時\",\"随时\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"週末我都在家，隨時歡迎你來玩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-02","sourceFront":"隨時","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"王老闆老是要求員工隨時配合他開會、加班、出差，真教人受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-27","sourceFront":"教","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有了無線網路，就可以隨時隨地上網查資料、看影片，或是玩遊戲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-35","sourceFront":"隨時隨地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的會議資料都存在雲端，這樣又安全又方便，各部門也能隨時參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-01","sourceFront":"雲端","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司辦公室裡有咖啡機，隨時想煮一壺熱咖啡都很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-08","sourceFront":"壺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命中每一刻都很珍貴，隨時多用點心、多付出，就能令人生更美好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-08","sourceFront":"刻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-2-11\",\"省錢\",\"省錢\",\"省钱\",\"Vs-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小歐為了省錢，整個月都吃泡麵，最後吃壞了身體，吃藥、住院花了更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-12","sourceFront":"泡麵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的朋友會理頭髮，為了省錢我們常常去找他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-17","sourceFront":"理頭髮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-17\",\"恢復\",\"恢復\",\"恢复\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"病人應該多休息，才能早一點兒恢復健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-17","sourceFront":"恢復","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個地區昨天夜裡突然停水、停電，還好今天中午就恢復正常了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-15","sourceFront":"停水","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只有集合大家的力量，有錢出錢、有力出力，才能幫助災民早一點恢復正常生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-32","sourceFront":"出力","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生的工作是讓病人恢復健康，甚至把寶貴的生命救回來，所以我們應該尊敬醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-37","sourceFront":"生命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"護理師告訴病人，得按三餐飯後的時間吃藥，才能快點恢復健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-20","sourceFront":"按","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天上午學校附近發生了車禍，經過警察處理後，現在交通已恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-11","sourceFront":"已","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"颱風過後，很多電線被強風吹壞了，需要幾天才能恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-10","sourceFront":"電線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統到地震災區慰問災民，並保證會協助他們恢復正常的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-09","sourceFront":"慰問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-24\",\"睡午觉\",\"睡午覺\",\"睡午觉\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-01\",\"安排\",\"安排\",\"安排\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個週末你有什麼安排？要不要一起去看電影？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-02","sourceFront":"安排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語中心除了有培養學生中文能力的課程，還安排了文化課，讓課程更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-32","sourceFront":"培養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要照溫老師安排的課程，多閱讀、多練習，你的中文就會有很大的進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-03","sourceFront":"進步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我考慮接受公司的安排，到國外協助市場調查工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-32","sourceFront":"考慮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年安排一段時間去旅行，說不定能帶給你更豐富的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-20","sourceFront":"說不定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時改變原來旅行的安排，可能會帶來不同的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-38","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一開始奧運僅安排男子比賽項目，後來才有女子項目的比賽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-12","sourceFront":"男子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-10\",\"检查\",\"檢查\",\"检查\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每次出國時，機場的安全人員都會檢查我們的護照和行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-10","sourceFront":"檢查","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:醫生，我求你快救救我的貓。 B:別急！我馬上檢查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-21","sourceFront":"求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司向每位員工發出健檢通知，上面寫著檢查時間、地點和需要注意的事情","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林伯伯覺得最近身體的毛病不少，可是說也奇怪，醫生檢查後都說他很正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-30","sourceFront":"說也奇怪","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統抵達新聞說明會的現場前，安全人員得先確認記者的資料，還得檢查他們的背包。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-01","sourceFront":"抵達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"史小姐做事很細心，這張表我檢查過好幾次，還是被她發現了幾個錯字。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-27","sourceFront":"細心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每次寫完考卷都會仔細檢查一遍，要是發現錯誤就馬上改過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過海關時，請配合相關人員檢查行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-18","sourceFront":"海關","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每天騎車上班前，總是習慣先檢查摩托車的輪子正不正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-14","sourceFront":"輪子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你帶著邀請卡給門口的服務人員檢查，才能入場參加活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-14","sourceFront":"入場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你來得正好，請你幫我檢查這些文件，我一個人實在做不來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-24","sourceFront":"正好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了旅客搭機安全，機場入境、出境時都要檢查行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-57","sourceFront":"出境","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的電腦無法上網，檢查之後才發現網路線沒有接著電腦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-04","sourceFront":"接","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"肚子痛有時不一定是消化器官的問題，得去醫院檢查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-21","sourceFront":"器官","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫師要我到廁所大便，再拿一點兒放在盒子送去檢查。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-49","sourceFront":"大便","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些病頭幾個月的症狀不明顯，得做進一步的檢查才能確定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-04","sourceFront":"症狀","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":