rceCardId":"B1L01-1-01","sourceFront":"新","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) joins a 丩(vine) to shout a name → 叫(be called)."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-1-22\",\"球员\",\"球員\",\"球员\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"球員的表現讓教練不斷搖頭，並表示得加強平常的訓練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-31","sourceFront":"搖頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L06-2-25\",\"開花\",\"開花\",\"开花\",\"Vp-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"科學家在他的時代所努力的結果，都可能會在未來開花結果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-31","sourceFront":"結果","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"To 開(open) a 花(flower): 開花 means blossom."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-1-13\",\"单纯\",\"單純\",\"单纯\",\"Vs/Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我妹妹的個性太單純了，別人說什麼她都相信，難怪常吃虧","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"經理找你談話，只是單純地想了解你對新工作適不適應，你別緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"跟大人比起來，小孩子的想法比較單純、天真，不會故意騙人","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-10","sourceFront":"天真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對我來說，擁有和平的日子其實是最單純的幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-21","sourceFront":"和平","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-23\",\"上帝\",\"上帝\",\"上帝\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有人信上帝，有人不信。但在東西方的文化中，「上帝」的角色都是很重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-23","sourceFront":"上帝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"有人說，這個世界是上帝創造的，你相信嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-15","sourceFront":"創造","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個壞人殺了人，他知道自己錯了，到教堂去請求上帝原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-22","sourceFront":"請求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上帝是不是存在，這是屬於宗教領域的問題，科學家的解釋不一定是正確的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-15","sourceFront":"領域","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大自然除了有各種動植物，還有山地、平原、河流等等，這一切應該是上帝創造的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-34","sourceFront":"大自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Stepping 上(above) into or toward 帝(supreme ruler): 上帝 means God, heavenly deity."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-13\",\"问候\",\"問候\",\"问候\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:好久沒看到你父母了，請替我問候他們。 B:沒問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-13","sourceFront":"問候","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在華人社會中，見面時晚輩先問候長輩是應有的禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-17","sourceFront":"晚輩","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-19\",\"假\",\"假\",\"假\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他打電話跟我說，他不能來上課，請我幫他請假。","pinyin":"Tā dǎ diànhuà gēn wǒ shuō, tā bù néng lái shàngkè, qǐng wǒ bāng tā qǐngjià.","english":"He gave me a call and told me that he couldn’t make it to class and asked me to ask for a leave for him.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師，國安今天要請假。他發燒了，不能來上課。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī, Guó'ān jīntiān yào qǐngjià. Tā fāshāo le, bù néng lái shàngkè.","english":"Teacher, Guoan has to take a leave today. He has a fever and he can’t come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) holds 叚(false) papers at the door → the whole story is 假(fake)."},{"key":"[\"B3L14-2-09\",\"错误\",\"錯誤\",\"错误\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我每次寫完考卷都會仔細檢查一遍，要是發現錯誤就馬上改過來","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"費太太結婚後才發現這是個錯誤決定，她不知道該怎麼辦才好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-09","sourceFront":"錯誤","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學習外國語言時最好能找位專業的老師，好改正自己的錯誤。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-10","sourceFront":"改正","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有不小心發生錯誤的時候，不需要取笑別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-22","sourceFront":"取笑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"仔細地思考是為了防止做出錯誤的決定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-20","sourceFront":"防止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錯誤通常來自粗心，因此無論事情大小都該用心處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-13","sourceFront":"來自","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-40\",\"基督教\",\"基督教\",\"基督教\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們全家都是信基督教的，不論教會舉辦什麼活動，我們都一定去參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-12","sourceFront":"教會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"The faith based on Christian 基(foundation) and 督(supervise) religious 教(education): 基督教 means Protestant Christianity."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-09\",\"刷子\",\"刷（子）\",\"刷（子）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他剛去超市買了一把刷子，想趁週末時好好把浴室刷乾淨。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-09","sourceFront":"刷子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"信用卡的正面和背面都有一組號碼，在線上刷卡時用得到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-12","sourceFront":"正面","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"刷卡買東西很方便，用讀卡機器刷一下信用卡就能付錢了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-08","sourceFront":"刷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我每天早上一醒來就去刷牙、洗臉，然後去附近國小的操場跑步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-19","sourceFront":"醒來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"刷卡購物時，店員會先確認你的簽名是不是和信用卡上的相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-12","sourceFront":"確認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"他太晚起床，趕快刷了牙就去上班了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-07","sourceFront":"刷牙","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"對上班族來說，上網買牙刷、內衣褲、面紙等日用品，既輕鬆又方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-18","sourceFront":"日用品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L05-2-17\",\"绳子\",\"繩（子）\",\"绳（子）\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我把房間裡那條黑色繩子看成蛇，嚇了我一大跳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-17","sourceFront":"繩子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-03\",\"选手\",\"選手\",\"选手\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"運動選手在參加比賽前，補充營養的飲食很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-03","sourceFront":"選手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"訓練出著名跳高選手的教練認為，要跳得高，技巧很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-15","sourceFront":"跳高","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"裁判的工作是確定每位選手都遵守規定，讓比賽順利進行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-25","sourceFront":"裁判","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-21\",\"尽力\",\"盡力\",\"尽力\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他告訴孩子不需要事事追求第一，但做任何事都必須盡力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-21","sourceFront":"盡力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"史\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) recites a 乂(cross) carved in stone → 史(history)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"對話\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Two speakers facing 對(correct) to share spoken 話(speech): 對話 means dialogue, conversation."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"已\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A coiled loop snapped shut like a finished knot shows the cycle is 已(already) done."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"菲\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) bloom rests with 非(fēi) petals → a 菲(fragrant) breeze."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"雲\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Before pouring down sheets of 雨(rain), vapor swirls like rolling 云(cloud mist) to form a dense 雲(cloud)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"風雨聲\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Hearing the blowing 風(wind) and falling 雨(rain) echo as natural 聲(sound once): 風雨聲 means sound of wind and rain."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"飲\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 飠(food) with 欠(lack) of a cool cup → the throat calls: 飲(drink)."}]}
